※ pl4g-test: compile=fail
※ pl4g-test: expect-diag 4426 LANG_MATCH_ARM_HAS_NO_VALUE

※ Where a value is wanted of a `match`, every arm has to have one, since any
※ of them may be the one that runs.

enum Colour { red ; green }
let chosen: mut Colour = Colour.red

@[startup]
fn main() → u8:
    let kept: u8 = match chosen:
        red:
            1u8
        green:
            let nothing: u8 = 2u8
    kept
